WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Import a PDF and set paper width and artwork spacing. Then generate fast, balanced and material-saving layouts.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Open the layout preview and check direction, quantity and spacing between images.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Choose a suitable layout and export TIFF through Photoshop to continue preparing for printing.
